






@(1 = 1-5) Say to @wDN{Utu} my lord, the exalted judge of heaven and earth, who cares for the Land, who renders verdicts; just god, who loves to keep man alive, who heeds entreaty, who extends mercy, who knows …… compassion, who loves justice, who selects honesty, ……:

@(6 = 6-11) Repeat to the bearded one, the son of @wDN{Ningal}, …… a lapis-lazuli beard,  @varh[t3205.v1]{who opens the bolts of heaven and earth } @vart[t3205.v2,t3205.v1]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} who opens the bolts }, who creates brightness in darkness; foremost lord who alone is resplendent, whose greatness is unequalled; warrior, son given birth by @wDN{Ningal}, who guards and gathers together the divine powers; just god, prince who determines all the fates, my lord, father of the black-headed: this is what @wRN{@wDN{Sîn}-iddinam}, king of @wSN{Larsam}, your servant, says:

